#### Core Concepts
- **How It Works**: Spot a price gap (e.g., ETH/USDC at $2,500 on Uniswap vs. $2,505 on Sushiswap), buy low/sell high in a single tx via flash loans. Profits come from the spread minus gas (~$5-20 on Ethereum L2s like Arbitrum).
- **Liquidity Focus**: In V3/V4, concentrated liquidity means LPs set price ranges—arbs target "out-of-range" positions where impermanent loss (IL) creates edges for rebalancers.
