   - **2025 Edge**: Use V4 hooks for on-pool TWAP (time-weighted average price) oracles to detect 0.1-0.5% gaps in <1s.
   - **Expected Yield**: 0.2-1% per arb; 10-50x daily on $10K capital via bots.
   - Example: On Arbitrum, arb ETH/WETH/USDC loops during volatility spikes (e.g., post-Fed announcements).

